            {
                "content": "```\nInput: heights = [4,2,3,1]\nOutput: [0,2,3]\n```\n**Explanation:** Building 1 (0-indexed) does not have an ocean view because building 2 is taller."
            },
            {
                "content": "```\nInput: heights = [4,3,2,1]\nOutput: [0,1,2,3]\n```\n**Explanation:** All the buildings have an ocean view."
            },
